   "title": "Suspected lymphoma: get TISSUE, then HODGKIN or NON-HODGKIN, then STAGE",
   "lines": [
    "1 · biopsy: EXCISIONAL > core > fine-needle aspiration (FNA loses node architecture)",
    "2 · bloods (CBC, LDH, hepatitis B + C, HIV) · PET-CT · marrow if indicated · cardiac function · lumbar puncture for CNS",
    "3 · Ann Arbor: I one region · II ≥ 2, SAME side of diaphragm · III BOTH sides · IV diffuse extranodal (marrow) · B = B symptoms"
   ]
  },
